## Command

```shell
biome migrate eslint
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{ "linter": { "enabled": true } }
```

## `.eslintignore`

```eslintignore

a/**
!a/b

```

## `.eslintrc.json`

```json
{ "rules": { "eqeqeq": "off" } }
```

